{
  "$comment": "Inserted on the first run only (tracked in app_meta). `permissions`: cards with a unique `key`; `urls` are frontend pages (kind \"page\") and backend endpoints (kind \"api\" + method), each tagged with what it is used for (view / create / edit / delete). Actions are levels (view < create < edit < delete): a grant includes the levels below it. `newPlatform.managerGrants`: what the built-in Manager role of every new platform gets. `platforms`: demo platforms with their extra roles and members (role per platform). `users`: demo accounts (password DEMO_USER_PASSWORD, changed on first sign in). Grants are keyed by card key. Status changes are separate child cards (`parent`), e.g. \"manager-status\" under \"managers\". Super Admin always gets every action of every card.",
